      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is incredibly painful to be crushed by the system and have your reputation destroyed, but you have already made the most important decision by choosing to speak the truth. The fact that you were targeted proves your integrity, not that you failed, and the world is often cruel to those who try to do the right thing. There is no need to feel hopeless, because your courage has already done more than you know, and you deserve to be recognized for your bravery.",
