    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just about being brave though. it feels like there's no way back from this. i look at the world and all i see is people who are willing to step on anyone to get ahead. i'm exhausted from fighting a war that's already lost. it honestly feels like the only way to actually find any peace is to just... stop. to just stop caring about everything and everyone. everything is just so heavy and dark all the time.",
